[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06100000_00_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06100000_00_0010","text":"总觉得雏菜好像有点饿了～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06100000_00_0020","text":"啊……\n我现在什么都没带"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06100000_00_0030","text":"那，去吗？\n便利店"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06100000_00_0040","text":"嗯～～～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06100000_00_0004","text":"能帮我跑个腿吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06100000_00_0005","text":"有点渴了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06100000_00_0006","text":"你忘带钱包了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06100000_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06100000_01_0010","text":"诶～～～？\n那给我点跑腿费嘛～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06100000_01_0020","text":"耶——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06100000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06100000_02_0010","text":"那、那我\n去买点喝的吧……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06100000_02_0020","text":"那制作人也一起去吧～！\n雏菜想吃奶油泡芙～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06100000_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06100000_03_0010","text":"诶……啊\n那个，是透酱的……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06100000_03_0020","text":"啊——\n是的"}]
